IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ama-paths`

-- Active Mobility Act 2017, ss 15-17, 22A, 23, 23A, 23B and the penalty provisions -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_active-mobility-act-2017.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`texting while riding` MEANS PhoneUse WITH
